title: Analytics › Period, payer and program menus
route: /analytics
intro: Three menus under the header change every figure, chart and breakdown on the page, and the monthly report. They are the only filters. There is no date picker and no search. 'Clear filters' puts payer and program back.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: other periods, payers and programs are worked out from the same invented tables, so they drift a little from this quarter. The period never counts as a filter in 'Clear filters', as on the Dashboard.
---
start s1 "On Analytics, look at the three menus"
screen sc "Menus 'This quarter', 'All payers' and 'All programs'\nAll read as plain pills until you change payer or program"

group gPeriod "Period menu"
  click c1 "Click 'This quarter'"
  overlay o1 "'This quarter', 'Last quarter', 'Last 12 months'"
  input i1 "Pick one"
endgroup

group gPayer "Payer menu"
  click c2 "Click 'All payers'"
  overlay o2 "'All payers', 'Cardinal Health Plan', 'Summit Medicaid HMO', 'Beacon PPO', 'Harborview MA', 'Lakeshore Behavioral', 'Evergreen'"
  input i2 "Pick one"
  process p2 "The payer pill turns green-edged and bold while it is not 'All payers'\nThe period pill never does"
endgroup

group gProgram "Program menu"
  click c4 "Click 'All programs'"
  overlay o4 "'All programs', 'Residential', 'IOP', 'PHP', 'Withdrawal management'"
  input i4 "Pick one"
  process p4 "The program pill turns green-edged and bold while it is not 'All programs'"
endgroup
goto gp "Continues in: Analytics › Program filter"

click cl "Click 'Clear filters'\nOnly shown while a payer or a program is picked"
process pcl "Payer and program return to 'All payers' and 'All programs'\nThe period stays"

input k1 "Keyboard in any menu\nArrow keys move, Enter picks, Esc closes"
click k2 "Click anywhere outside an open menu"
process p1 "Menu closes, value unchanged"

process r1 "Page recomputes at once from the period, the payer and the program"
process r2 "Subtitles use the period: 'this quarter', 'last quarter' or 'the last 12 months'\nA picked program is added after a dot, for example 'this quarter · IOP'\nCounts scale: last quarter about 0.96, last 12 months about 3.9 times"
process r4 "The denial outcomes follow the menus too\nRulings, accepted denials and dismissals recorded in this demo count in 'This quarter' and 'Last 12 months', not in 'Last quarter'\nOne payer or one program: only theirs"
process r3 "One payer: the approval bars show that payer against 'All payers'\nThe denial table lists all of that payer's reasons\nThe preventable chart shows that payer's fixable reasons\n'What helps most' is re-weighted for that payer"
process r5 "Workload follows the payer and the program but not the period\nIt is the Dashboard's requests right now"
decision q1 "Is a figure built on 20 or more decisions (or denials)?"
screen ok "The number shows, for example 86%"
screen hid "Figure shows '-' with 'Not enough decisions yet'\nA card shows 'Not enough decisions yet. Figures based on fewer than 20 decisions stay hidden.'"
toast ex "Example: 'Lakeshore Behavioral' and 'This quarter'\n'Top denial cause' and 'Advice taken works' are hidden, as are the table and the list"
process p3 "Nothing goes into the address\nLeaving and returning resets to 'This quarter', 'All payers' and 'All programs'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › Open and build"
end e1 "Page matches the three menus"

s1 --> sc
sc --> c1 --> o1 --> i1 --> r1
sc --> c2 --> o2 --> i2 --> r1
sc --> c4 --> o4 --> i4 --> r1
i2 --> p2
i4 --> p4
i4 -.-> gp
o1 & o2 & o4 --> k1
o1 & o2 & o4 --> k2 --> p1
k1 --> r1
i2 & i4 --> cl --> pcl --> r1
r1 --> r2 --> q1
r1 --> r4 --> q1
r1 --> r3
r3 --> q1
r1 -.-> r5
q1 -->|Yes| ok --> e1
q1 -->|No| hid --> ex --> e1
r1 -.-> p3
r1 -.-> g1
